---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Why HealthMaps exists: free, independent, plain-language guidance for navigating Australia's mental health system."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section>
    <div class="max-w-body mx-auto px-4 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-12 md:pb-16">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-body font-semibold mb-3">The project</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-[2.5rem] font-bold text-heading tracking-[-0.01em] leading-tight">About HealthMaps</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-paper-cream">
    <div class="max-w-body mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-20 space-y-14 md:space-y-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mb-4">Why this site exists</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
          I think the healthcare system in general has become difficult to navigate and understand,
          and that puts people off getting help.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
          I find I commonly see a professional, without really knowing how much it will cost me, why,
          and how to pay and if I need a referral.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
          I have started with mental health but aim to eventually map out the whole health system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mb-4">What this site is</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
          HealthMaps aims to provide the map. For example: how to get a referral to a psychologist,
          how much it will cost out of pocket, and what the difference is between a clinical and a
          general psychologist.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mb-4">Who's behind it</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
          HealthMaps is an independent project built by Jethro Hedstrom, a physiotherapist based in
          northern NSW.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
          It's self-funded, carries no advertising, and has no political or commercial ties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="rounded-xl bg-page-sage border border-pencil p-6 md:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-2">What this site is not</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
          HealthMaps provides general information about how the Australian mental health system works.
          It is not medical advice, it can't diagnose anything, and it's not a crisis service.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
          If you're in crisis, please use the urgent help numbers available on every page of this site.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <div class="pt-10 border-t border-border">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading mb-4">Get in touch</h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
          Spotted something out of date? Have feedback, or a story? Want to roast the site? Email
          <!-- REVIEW: consider a dedicated address (e.g. hello@healthmaps.com.au) instead of a personal one -->
          <a href="mailto:jethrohedstrom@gmail.com" class="text-primary font-semibold underline underline-offset-2">jethrohedstrom@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
